      <div class="exp-card reveal d2"><div class="exp-icon ei-amber"><span class="exp-num">03</span></div><h3>Content Architecture</h3><p>Topic clusters and intent mapping built for how models interpret authority, so a site earns citations across a topic rather than on one lucky page.</p></div>
      <div class="exp-card reveal d3"><div class="exp-icon ei-cyan"><span class="exp-num">04</span></div><h3>Measurement &amp; Automation</h3><p>Python, BigQuery and n8n pipelines that pull GA4 and Search Console data, segment LLM referrals, and report without anyone exporting a spreadsheet. Auditable, so a number can be checked.</p></div>
